47dee8d156e5e0e.jpg_.webp\" alt=\"sac_pin_double_pow_d03_sac_da_nang-2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/a5/20/b7/3642bbf8a96b2e3ccc741cd986482b2c.jpg_.webp\" alt=\"sac_pin_double_pow_d03_sac_da_nang-3.jpg\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/57/0a/93/c1549344a103e4f7f753502591ec22a6.jpg_.webp\" alt=\"sac_pin_double_pow_d03_sac_da_nang-5.jpg\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/af/34/c4/a24594ebfbc8a0e420c1e558ff48e673.jpg_.webp\" alt=\"sac_pin_double_pow_d03_sac_da_nang-4.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHãng sản xuất: Doublepow\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSạc được các loại pin: 9V 6F22, pin tiểu AA, pin đũa AAA\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eĐiện áp 1.2V\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMã sản phẩm: DP-D03\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSạc được 2 pin 9V hoặc 4 pin tiểu, pin đũa\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/9c/de/7b/eb8449adab7520ebd25eb48bb4407289.jpg_.webp\" alt=\"3.jpg\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/8d/1f/f1/472bdf4806618b219aaa20280643c264.jpg_.webp\" alt=\"pin_sac_9v_doublepow_giadungnhaviet_com-3.jpg\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/92/64/e9/81c20be1103b1a540285e3fdb8aa8346.jpg_.webp\" alt=\"619134-57512-pin-sac-9v-doublepow-giadungnhaviet-com--5--fpoz73rjvxv1fvadqdox.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHướng dẫn sử dụng Bộ Sạc Pin đa năng 9V, pin AA, AAA Doublepow DP-D03\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Cắm điện cho máy sạc\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Lắp pin cần sạc vào máy sạc\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Sau khi sạc đầy \u0026gt; lấy pin ra khỏi ngăn sạc.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Nếu muốn sạc một bộ pin tiếp theo bạn phải đợi khoảng 1/2 tiếng mới nên sạc tiếp.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e